---
import BaseLayout from '@shared/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '@shared/components/Nav.astro';
import vertebraLock from '@shared/assets/brand/concepts/vertebra-lock.webp';
import nerveRail from '@shared/assets/brand/concepts/nerve-rail.webp';
import servoSnout from '@shared/assets/brand/concepts/servo-snout.webp';
import maglockCoil from '@shared/assets/brand/concepts/maglock-coil.webp';
import irisSentinel from '@shared/assets/brand/concepts/iris-sentinel.webp';
import '@shared/styles/logo-study.css';

const canonical = new URL('/logo-study/', Astro.site);
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Camm Studios logo study"
  description="A private comparison of five glass robotic constructions for the current Camm Studios snake mark."
  canonical={canonical}
  robots="noindex, nofollow"
>
  <div class="logo-study-page">
    <Nav links={[{ href: '/', label: 'Company' }]} />
    <main id="main" class="logo-study shell">
      <header class="logo-study__header">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Identity study / private</p>
          <h1>One serpent.<br />Five engineered bodies.</h1>
        </div>
        <p>Every option keeps the current C-shaped snake, squared coil, head, tail, and circular eye. Only the robotic mechanism changes.</p>
      </header>

      <section class="logo-study__grid" aria-label="Camm Studios logo concepts">
        <article class="logo-concept" data-recommended>
          <div class="logo-concept__stage">
            <p class="logo-concept__index">01 / Recommended</p>
            <img src={vertebraLock.src} alt="Vertebra Lock glass robotic snake concept" width="1024" height="1024" />
          </div>
          <div class="logo-concept__body">
            <div class="logo-concept__title"><p>Concept 01</p><h2>Vertebra Lock</h2><a href={vertebraLock.src} download>Download artwork ↘</a></div>
            <p>Eight crystal vertebrae preserve the compact coil while graphite joints make the snake unmistakably mechanical.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Motion</dt><dd>A restrained compression wave travels from tail to eye, then every joint locks flush.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Identity</dt><dd>The clearest robotic reading and the strongest silhouette at small sizes.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="logo-concept">
          <div class="logo-concept__stage">
            <p class="logo-concept__index">02 / Monocoque</p>
            <img src={nerveRail.src} alt="Nerve Rail glass robotic snake concept" width="1024" height="1024" />
          </div>
          <div class="logo-concept__body">
            <div class="logo-concept__title"><p>Concept 02</p><h2>Nerve Rail</h2><a href={nerveRail.src} download>Download artwork ↘</a></div>
            <p>One internal graphite rail traces the complete body path through an uninterrupted quartz shell.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Motion</dt><dd>A white signal carriage runs from the tail into the optical eye.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Identity</dt><dd>The most minimal form, with the hidden snake path made visible.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="logo-concept">
          <div class="logo-concept__stage">
            <p class="logo-concept__index">03 / Kinetic</p>
            <img src={servoSnout.src} alt="Servo Snout glass robotic snake concept" width="1024" height="1024" />
          </div>
          <div class="logo-concept__body">
            <div class="logo-concept__title"><p>Concept 03</p><h2>Servo Snout</h2><a href={servoSnout.src} download>Download artwork ↘</a></div>
            <p>Visible rack drives and a two-axis sensor turn the original rectangular head into a working robotic module.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Motion</dt><dd>The snout extends, performs one precise scan, and retracts into the coil.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Identity</dt><dd>The most technical option, with the head carrying the character.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="logo-concept">
          <div class="logo-concept__stage">
            <p class="logo-concept__index">04 / Magnetic</p>
            <img src={maglockCoil.src} alt="Maglock Coil glass robotic snake concept" width="1024" height="1024" />
          </div>
          <div class="logo-concept__body">
            <div class="logo-concept__title"><p>Concept 04</p><h2>Maglock Coil</h2><a href={maglockCoil.src} download>Download artwork ↘</a></div>
            <p>Five heavy crystal sections float around exposed magnetic collars before resolving into the source silhouette.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Motion</dt><dd>Hairline gaps open from tail to head, then snap back into one compact mark.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Identity</dt><dd>The boldest large-scale construction with the calmest internal detail.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="logo-concept">
          <div class="logo-concept__stage">
            <p class="logo-concept__index">05 / Optical</p>
            <img src={irisSentinel.src} alt="Iris Sentinel glass robotic snake concept" width="1024" height="1024" />
          </div>
          <div class="logo-concept__body">
            <div class="logo-concept__title"><p>Concept 05</p><h2>Iris Sentinel</h2><a href={irisSentinel.src} download>Download artwork ↘</a></div>
            <p>A double-wall ribbed body feeds a detailed mechanical iris housed inside the original circular eye.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Motion</dt><dd>The iris focuses once while a neutral caustic runs around the squared coil.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Identity</dt><dd>The strongest watchful character and the richest optical surface.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>

      <footer class="logo-study__footer">
        <p>Private design study. This page is excluded from search indexing.</p>
        <a href="/">Return to Camm Studios</a>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
